---
import Layout from '../../layouts/default.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact MECS | Check whether your job is suitable" description="Contact MECS about remote-first fixed-price IT support for computers, Linux, Docker, storage, hardware and small networks.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="intro">
      <h1>Tell MECS what is happening</h1>
      <p>
        Send a short description of the problem and MECS will check whether it fits one of the fixed-price services.
      </p>
      <p>
        Support is remote-first and by appointment. Enquiries are checked for suitability before work is accepted.
        MECS does not offer emergency, 24/7 or guaranteed-response support.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Email contact -->
    <section class="email-contact">
      <h2>Email MECS</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:mr.markeggleston@gmail.com?subject=MECS%20service%20enquiry" class="cta-button">Email MECS</a></p>
      <p class="email-address">Or copy this address: <span>mr.markeggleston@gmail.com</span></p>
    </section>

    <!-- Enquiry checklist -->
    <section class="enquiry-checklist">
      <h2>What to include in your email</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The device or system you need help with</li>
        <li>A short description of the problem</li>
        <li>When you are available for an appointment</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Include your name so I know how to address you. If more detail is needed, I’ll ask about error messages, recent changes, internet access and backups before confirming the appointment.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Security warning -->
    <section class="security-warning">
      <h2>Security warning</h2>
      <p>
        Do not email passwords, recovery codes, private keys, API tokens, remote-access credentials or payment-card details.
      </p>
      <p>
        MECS will never ask you to send a password by email. Where credentials are required during an attended session,
        you enter them yourself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- What happens next -->
    <section class="what-happens-next">
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>MECS reviews whether the enquiry is suitable for remote support.</li>
        <li>If suitable, MECS confirms the scope, fixed price and appointment before work begins.</li>
        <li>Remote access is started only with the customer’s permission during the agreed session.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing reminder -->
    <section class="pricing-reminder">
      <h2>Pricing reminder</h2>
      <p>
        Fixed-price services currently range from £55 to £85. Additional remote time, where suitable and agreed in advance,
        is £27.50 per 30 minutes.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/services/" class="cta-button">View full service scopes and prices</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        MECS is not VAT registered, so no VAT is added to the displayed prices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Privacy notice -->
    <section class="privacy-notice">
      <p>
        <a href="/privacy/">Read how enquiry information is handled</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>